{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33747","headline":"七爱诗 房杜二相国 · 皮日休","name":"七爱诗 房杜二相国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱房与杜，贫贱共联步。\n脱身抛乱世，策杖归真主。\n纵横握中算，左右天下务。\n肮脏无敌才，磊落不世遇。\n美矣名公卿，魁然真宰辅。\n黄阁三十年，清风一万古。\n巨业照国史，大勳镇王府。\n遂使後世民，至今受陶铸。\n粤吾少有志，敢蹑前贤路。\n苟得同其时，愿爲执鞭竖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}